### Title
`conda env config` help text should only suggest valid commands

### Why
conda should not suggest users to run commands that do not exist or will produce an error.

### Platforms
- [x] Windows
- [x] macOS
- [x]] Linux

### Prerequisites
none

### Steps
Run 
```
conda env config --help
```

and 

```
conda env config vars --help
```

### Pass criteria
Ensure that all help example commands are valid by running the commands in the environment.

